**ex parte,** when used as an adj., should be hyphened: *speaking ex parte,* but *an ex-parte statement*; see ^^HYPHENS^^ (Group ∗*sub judice*).

**expatiation.** See ^^-CIATION^^.

**expect.** Exception is often taken
