E. by itself is used as short for e. to find, e. that it will turn out that, that is all:—I e. he will be in time; I e. he is there by this time; I e. he was there; Ie,
===
*E.* by itself is used as short for *e. to find, e. that it will turn out that,* that is all:—*I e. he will be in time; I e. he is there by this time; I e. he was there; I e.*
